DISCLAIMER: This is a satire. Everything in it is made of polygons, and every
polygon you smash is billed to a generation that does not exist yet. Do not
smash real things. Real bus shelters do not respawn, real police do not fall
over after one shove, and real debt does not reset when you press "Log back in".
The author accepts no liability for broken windows, broken friendships, broken
follower counts, or the sudden realisation that the views were never worth it.
If this software makes you go outside and touch grass, please open an issue so
we can fix that bug.

